==============================================================================================================================
E-5  SEPARATION, ADDITIVITY, EXTENSIVITY -- EXACT
==============================================================================================================================

S0   REPRESENTATIVE AUDIT OF THE INTEGER INTERSECTION LIFTS  (governs how E-1 may be read).
     For each record pair, sweep a -> a xor s over the whole stabiliser group and report the
     EXACT set of values each lift takes.  A lift with more than one value on that orbit is a
     property of the REPRESENTATIVE, not of the record.
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  n     quantity                       orbit size       values over the orbit (exact)  record observable?            
  4     sp_F2(a,b)                     16               [0]                            YES -- a record observable    
  4     I_unsigned(a,b)                16               [0, 2]                         NO -- representative-dependent
  4     I_signed(a,b)                  16               [-2, 0, 2]                     NO -- representative-dependent
  4     I_overlap(a,b)                 16               [1, 2, 4]                      NO -- representative-dependent
  6     sp_F2(a,b)                     16               [0]                            YES -- a record observable    
  6     I_unsigned(a,b)                16               [0, 2, 4]                      NO -- representative-dependent
  6     I_signed(a,b)                  16               [-4, -2, 0, 2, 4]              NO -- representative-dependent
  6     I_overlap(a,b)                 16               [1, 2, 3, 4, 6]                NO -- representative-dependent
  8     sp_F2(a,b)                     16               [0]                            YES -- a record observable    
  8     I_unsigned(a,b)                16               [0, 2, 6]                      NO -- representative-dependent
  8     I_signed(a,b)                  16               [-6, -4, -2, 0, 2, 4, 6]       NO -- representative-dependent
  8     I_overlap(a,b)                 16               [1, 2, 5, 6, 8]                NO -- representative-dependent
  10    sp_F2(a,b)                     16               [0]                            YES -- a record observable    
  10    I_unsigned(a,b)                16               [0, 2, 8]                      NO -- representative-dependent
  10    I_signed(a,b)                  16               [-8, -6, -2, 0, 2, 6, 8]       NO -- representative-dependent
  10    I_overlap(a,b)                 16               [1, 2, 7, 8, 10]               NO -- representative-dependent

  VERDICT PER QUANTITY (over n = 4,6,8,10):
     sp_F2(a,b)             invariant at every n tested: True
     I_unsigned(a,b)        invariant at every n tested: False
     I_signed(a,b)          invariant at every n tested: False
     I_overlap(a,b)         invariant at every n tested: False

